6787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the devil is on duty, that doesn't mean he can't get up to some mischief for his own enjoyment. Oh, and there will be plenty opportunities for that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969610/extras/e291ae263c4030a6b38c74a4ae74180e.avif?t=1780326787\" width=616 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Location - Saint Petersburg during the first years after its founding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative history. Real historical figures in fictional circumstances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plotlines from fables and everyday fairy tales about devils, soldiers, thieves and fools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian lubok as the basis for the game visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Folk music with modern arrangement.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "An adventure game with crafting and transformations about a devil in the service of Peter the Great. Play as a little imp - trick, lie, steal and cheat in order to get your way and move up the ladder!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969610/ac21a1c06f1ff3d0bf3b5ca31b1cbfa8051ddb22/header.jpg?t=1780326787", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969610/057a1276a9ed94925be5f18011e869d62ddb9345/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780326787", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969610/057a1276a9ed94925be5f18011e869d62ddb9345/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780326787", "website": "https://babayagagames.ru/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit OS required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-7100, AMD Ryzen 3 1200 AF<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 1030, AMD Radeon R7 240 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Baba Yaga Games"], "publishers": ["Baba Yaga Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 75, "description": "Keyboard Only Option"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969610/0cb060da80cd3a03205df3fbe47fc4471aa343a6/ss_0cb060da80cd3a03205df3fbe47fc4471aa343a6.600x338.jpg?t=1780326787", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969610/0cb060da80cd3a03205df3fbe47fc4471aa343a6/ss_0cb060da80cd3a03205df3fbe47fc4471aa343a6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780326787"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969610/05b5e54f28b9c0e1e4ad3f66915d617579432e1d/ss_05b5e54f28b9c0e1e4ad3f66915d617579432e1d.600x338.jpg?t=1780326787", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969610/05b5e54f28b9c0e1e4ad3f66915d617579432e1d/ss_05b5e54f28b9c0e1